   "body": "LOT-095 (#293) note for LOT-137: the router (HFRLinkRoute) and the LOT-083 ReaderTarget(link:) (App/SwiftHFR/Reader/ReaderTarget.swift:45-60) currently disagree (ReaderTarget reads page=1 on numreponse links and opens canonical paths of forums the catalogue does not know). LOT-137 should build ReaderTarget from HFRLinkRoute (.topic / .privateMessageThread; page nil + numreponse goes through HFREndpoint.topicPage(topic:page:numreponse:)) so there is one parser. Recorded in docs/lots/LOT-095-link-router.md.",
